Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.36,0:00:03.44,main,Sister B,0,0,0,,Holy Laplace is the creator of our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:06.45,main,Sister B,0,0,0,,And when she departed our world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.45,0:00:10.40,main,Sister B,0,0,0,,she gifted the people with special powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:12.36,main,Sister B,0,0,0,,Do you know what those are?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:13.58,main,Orphans,0,0,0,,Skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:15.36,main,Sister B,0,0,0,,Correct. Skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:20.83,main,Sister B,0,0,0,,Let us give thanks to Holy Laplace \Nas we enjoy our bounty for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:22.90,main,Orphans,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.85,0:00:32.04,main,Sister B,0,0,0,,Why aren't you eating? Do you feel all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:34.22,main,Boy Orphan,0,0,0,,Holy Laplace doesn't play fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:37.66,main,Boy Orphan,0,0,0,,The holy knights and warriors \Nhave amazing skills...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:41.45,main,Boy Orphan,0,0,0,,So why do I have such a weak one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.45,0:00:43.64,main,Boy Orphan,0,0,0,,I bet that's why I was abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:49.11,main,Sister B,0,0,0,,In the old times, when Holy \NLaplace protected the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:53.00,main,Sister B,0,0,0,,there were no skills or stats, \Nnor did monsters exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.74,main,Sister B,0,0,0,,Back then, everyone was equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:00:59.05,main,Boy Orphan,0,0,0,,I wish I had been born back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.66,0:01:06.54,main,Sister A,0,0,0,,I've searched nearby, but I can't find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:07.33,main,Sister B,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.33,0:01:08.76,main,Sister A,0,0,0,,I'll check in town, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.71,0:01:13.67,main,Sister B,0,0,0,,Sahara...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.67,0:01:15.47,main,Sister B,0,0,0,,Where have you gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.51,0:01:20.93,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,Come on, keep crying! Make some more noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.93,0:01:26.97,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,You're gonna be a toy for the holy knights!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.76,0:01:31.44,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,Dammit, this is gonna be such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.37,0:01:42.72,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You're gonna be okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:22.97,sign_harsh_red,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(400,400\blur1)\pos(481.391,284.611)}Hunger Boost
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.31,0:03:23.72,top,Fate,0,0,0,,Come on, this is our chance \Nto get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.19,0:03:27.59,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,I run into guys like you, sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.14,0:03:32.10,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,Dumbasses who waltz in here outta \Nsome misguided notion of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.68,0:03:38.53,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,Well, look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.10,0:03:42.25,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,You gonna be able to fight \Nwhile protecting the runt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:47.56,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I need to at least get her to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.97,0:03:49.70,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,But where is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:51.94,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I've got an idea, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:54.00,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Go ahead and back away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:57.06,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,He thinks you're weaker than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:03:59.35,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,We'll take advantage of that confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.35,0:04:00.46,main,Fate,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.14,0:04:10.77,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,You knock those boxes down, \Nand you'll be the one I bury first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.77,0:04:15.93,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,You ever think about how, if I kill \Nyour stupid ass in front of the kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.93,0:04:20.63,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,she'll become totally obedient?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:22.58,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Now, Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.91,0:04:33.79,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,Just had to make it hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.79,0:04:35.82,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,Now you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:38.29,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Sharp Edge, huh? That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.57,0:04:40.86,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Fate! Strike him down through his weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:42.46,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That's the plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:49.14,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:55.36,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You said she was going to the holy knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.36,0:04:58.65,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Answer me. Who was it \Nthat had you kidnap this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.65,0:05:00.95,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,I'm not saying a damn thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:05.77,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Talk! Who's the piece of trash\N that hired you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.56,0:05:08.47,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,Fine! I'll tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.47,0:05:09.16,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Who was it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:11.74,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,Hado! Hado Vlerick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:24.78,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You're okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.78,0:05:25.74,main,Sahara,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:31.60,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Hungry now that you've relaxed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:34.51,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Wanna get something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:36.39,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Uh, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.07,0:05:38.10,main,Sahara,0,0,0,,Sahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:39.70,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:43.07,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Okay, let me treat you to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:47.49,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'll take two, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:48.76,main,Stall Cook,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.01,0:05:50.91,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.23,0:05:53.24,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's hot, so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:05:58.54,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I told you to be careful...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:00.48,main,Sahara,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:03.01,main,Sahara,0,0,0,,I've never had meat before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:20.93,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You can have mine, too, Sahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.20,0:06:23.21,main,Sahara,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:25.86,main,Sister A,0,0,0,,Sahara!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:28.31,main,Sahara,0,0,0,,Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.52,0:06:39.97,main,Sister A,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.97,0:06:42.08,main,Sahara,0,0,0,,Thank you, Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.95,0:06:45.51,main,Sister A,0,0,0,,Is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.51,0:06:46.51,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.45,0:06:51.14,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I don't think anyone's ever thanked me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:53.47,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Because I've got a waste of a skill, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.47,0:06:56.43,main,Sahara,0,0,0,,Your skill is weak, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:06:59.15,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I just get hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.15,0:07:00.25,main,Sahara,0,0,0,,Your tummy...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:01.30,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.87,0:07:05.00,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Sahara, no matter how hard things get,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:07.57,main,Fate,0,0,0,,if you can laugh them off, \None day you'll find happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.35,0:07:09.53,main,Sahara,0,0,0,,Even me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:10.58,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.08,0:07:12.82,flashback,Dean,0,0,0,,Fay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:14.89,flashback,Dean,0,0,0,,No matter how hard things get,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.89,0:07:17.66,flashback,Dean,0,0,0,,if you can laugh them off, \Nyou'll be happy one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.99,0:07:20.14,flashback,Fate,0,0,0,,Someone like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:21.05,flashback,Dean,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:25.69,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Back then, I didn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:30.68,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,But Dad telling me that... \Nhelped me make it to this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.91,0:07:39.14,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Which is why... \NI want Sahara to survive, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:46.52,italicstop,Greed,0,0,0,,Looks like you've got One-Handed \NSword Technique now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:46.53,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(23.772,86.979)}[Stats]
