Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.07,0:07:46.53,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs15\pos(316.673,198.032)}Concealment, One-Handed Sword Technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.88,0:07:49.37,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Congrats on your first technical skill, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.37,0:07:50.89,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Is that a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:51.82,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:55.01,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,With technical skills, you get tech-arts, \Nwhich are like secret techniques...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.01,0:07:58.54,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,In this case, you're able to \Nattack twice in the space of one strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:08:00.25,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That's the Sharp Edge you mentioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.11,0:08:03.96,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Wait, then if he had been \Nable to actually land his—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:05.88,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You'd have been in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:07.92,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Hell, you'd probably be done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:10.01,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You could've warned me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.01,0:08:13.22,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,A hero was in the middle \Nof saving a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.01,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What kinda jerk interrupts that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:17.73,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm no hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.05,0:08:20.47,main,Fate,0,0,0,,If I had known, I wouldn't have risked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.47,0:08:24.36,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Sure, sure. Don't go getting embarrassed \Njust because you showed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.36,0:08:25.44,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.78,0:08:28.89,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The truth is, battles come down \Nto luck of the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.89,0:08:31.14,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,There's no guarantee \Nthe stronger person always wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:34.28,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,So I had luck on my side this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:37.30,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I want to get stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:41.23,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Strong enough that I can win \Nwithout getting lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.23,0:08:43.39,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I was meaning to ask, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.91,0:08:46.93,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's your first day working \Nfor the Harts, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.93,0:08:47.66,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:49.94,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You're gonna go looking like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:55.77,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I forgot to buy clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:57.36,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Don't drop me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.36,0:08:59.68,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Be a little more careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.41,0:09:03.95,main,Old Ad,0,0,0,,Did you hear the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.95,0:09:07.77,main,Old Ad,0,0,0,,Sir Mason was struck down \Nby a Divine Dragon in Galia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.77,0:09:10.75,main,Old Ad,0,0,0,,A warrior friend of mine had \Nthe news, so it's certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:12.73,main,Barkeep,0,0,0,,What happens to the Hart family, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:15.70,main,Old Ad,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy will succeed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:18.30,main,Old Ad,0,0,0,,But Sir Mason was the one \Nkeeping the holy knights
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:20.11,main,Old Ad,0,0,0,,from going completely out of control...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.11,0:09:23.97,main,Old Ad,0,0,0,,I'm not sure that even Lady Roxy \Ncan keep them in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.97,0:09:26.80,main,Barkeep,0,0,0,,You mean the Vlerick siblings?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:28.75,main,Barkeep,0,0,0,,Never good news with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:32.81,main,Barkeep,0,0,0,,I only like talking about pleasant topics.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:36.97,main,Old Ad,0,0,0,,How's Fate been?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.14,0:09:41.72,main,Barkeep,0,0,0,,He used to drop by after work every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:57.57,main,Fate,0,0,0,,So this is the holy knight district...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.45,0:10:07.96,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This place is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:13.13,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.01,0:10:23.71,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:29.94,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I've been waiting. I'm so glad you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.81,0:10:32.90,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:36.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Uh, you're just... so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:39.03,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I was a little... speechless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.27,0:10:41.52,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.52,0:10:44.97,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I suppose it's good \Nthat I dress up, occasionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:48.16,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,You've cleaned up quite nicely yourself, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.16,0:10:49.37,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Nah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.37,0:10:51.13,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Come, right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.31,0:11:00.47,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,A grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.63,0:11:06.23,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Father, this is Fate, who will be \Nworking here starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.23,0:11:09.82,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I'm sure things will be lively \Naround the manor again now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:11.69,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.69,0:11:12.86,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,My father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:18.15,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Five days ago he encountered a Divine \NDragon in Galia... and passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.72,0:11:23.14,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Galia is a continent that's \Ndominated by monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.69,0:11:28.00,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,One of the holy knight's major duties \Nis keeping them contained.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.59,0:11:31.16,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,That duty fell to the Hart family, this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:35.14,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,A dangerous task, but not one \Nthat should've been deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.67,0:11:41.61,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,But... a Divine Dragon, that hadn't\Nleft its lair in over a thousand years...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:45.68,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,My father's force was killed to the last man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.68,0:11:47.42,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.74,0:11:51.99,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,In a situation like that, \Nshe's still been looking out for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:57.07,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,And I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:01.03,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Don't look so sad, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.48,0:12:04.32,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I am the head of House Hart, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:06.80,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Let's work together to make it a joyful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:08.80,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Can I count on your help?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.27,0:12:11.20,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yes. It'd be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.87,0:12:17.90,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Wait! If I touch her now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.90,0:12:19.42,flashback italics,Roxy,0,0,0,,It's worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.42,0:12:21.15,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Telepathy will activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.53,0:12:23.77,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.21,0:12:26.01,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Haru!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:31.29,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Haru, this is Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:35.44,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm Fate Graphite. It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:39.45,main,Haru,0,0,0,,I'm Haru, chief maid for the Hart estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:46.01,main,Haru,0,0,0,,I ask you to comport yourself in a manner \Nbefitting a servant of the Hart family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:48.74,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:51.28,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:56.12,main,Fate,0,0,0,,So meaty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:57.48,main,Maid D,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.48,0:12:59.55,top,Maid E,0,0,0,,He must really like meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.48,0:13:00.60,main,Haru,0,0,0,,A manner befitting \Na servant of the Hart family...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.22,0:13:08.81,main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Hey, don't forget to take a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.27,0:13:13.27,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Right, Mr. Oliver. I'll get some rest \Nafter I wrap up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.27,0:13:15.65,main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Try not to overdo it, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.65,0:13:18.23,main,Minerva,0,0,0,,It's already been a week \Nsince you started here...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.23,0:13:19.69,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yes, Mr. Minerva.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.69,0:13:24.65,main,Minerva,0,0,0,,At first, I thought you were a weirdo \Nwho was always talking to a sword...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.16,0:13:27.79,main,Oliver,0,0,0,,And you were shaking when you ate meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:32.41,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It'd been five years since \NI had any! Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:36.96,main,Minerva,0,0,0,,Come on, kid, we just had lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:38.46,main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Did you actually eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:40.66,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Of course I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.02,0:13:43.99,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I guess it's a growth spurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.90,0:13:45.81,main,Haru,0,0,0,,Mr. Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.81,0:13:46.51,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Ms. Haru.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.99,0:13:48.72,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The mistress is calling for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.72,0:13:50.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Sure. Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.17,0:13:51.10,main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Back to work for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:51.93,main,Minerva,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.26,0:13:56.89,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,This is weird. \NI actually had something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.82,0:14:14.91,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Have you gotten used to working here, Fay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.38,0:14:19.83,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm feeling hungrier and hungrier...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.14,0:14:21.21,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.79,0:14:24.19,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I won't be able to hold back much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:25.45,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.45,0:14:26.67,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.89,0:14:29.59,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Fay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.59,0:14:30.39,flashback,Dean,0,0,0,,Fay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:31.60,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.21,0:14:33.81,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.25,0:14:37.49,main,Fate,0,0,0,,My late father would call me that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.49,0:14:39.05,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,You lost your father, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:42.27,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah. He was killed in a monster hunt...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.27,0:14:44.63,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Just like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:48.10,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Why "Fay," though?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.10,0:14:49.89,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,It's a nickname, for Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.89,0:14:53.81,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Remember what I said about us making \Nthe Hart estate a joyful place?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.81,0:14:55.66,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,You're basically one of the family!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.66,0:14:57.41,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,F-Family?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.41,0:15:01.08,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,M-Me and Lady Roxy...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:02.30,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I think I'd rather be Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:03.25,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Request denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:06.89,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,What... is happening...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.89,0:15:08.91,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay? Fay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.19,0:15:16.78,main,Fate,0,0,0,,My room...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:26.48,italics,Roxy,0,0,0,,Please take tomorrow off \Nfrom work and be sure to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.22,0:15:28.44,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:32.15,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Hey, Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.15,0:15:33.01,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:35.62,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:39.78,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It never got this bad before. \NI could hold it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:41.32,main,Fate,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.32,0:15:44.28,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You're just now asking? \NThe die's been cast, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:47.73,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Once the Gluttony skill gets a taste \Nof souls, there's no stopping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:49.01,main,Fate,0,0,0,,There's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:52.31,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Right. The more you devour,\N the stronger you get,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.31,0:15:55.08,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,and the more you devour, the more you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:58.58,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You're destined to seek out souls \Nto consume until the day you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:02.52,main,Fate,0,0,0,,And... if I don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:04.02,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You'll starve to death...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.54,0:16:08.17,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,or lose control and start \Nattacking anyone in your path.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:10.09,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Anyone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.54,0:16:14.16,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That just... makes me sound like a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:16.64,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Here's a little tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.64,0:16:19.75,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,When your hunger approaches its limit, \Nit'll be visible in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:27.85,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I'll tell you again: the die's been cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.85,0:16:29.65,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,There's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:35.72,main,Warrior Boss,0,0,0,,All right, let's hunt a lot, and earn a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.05,0:16:39.80,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,They smell delicious for some reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.80,0:16:42.77,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Probably because your \NHunger Boost has kicked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:44.65,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Is that what these red eyes are?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.65,0:16:51.32,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Yeah. Hunger Boost is a temporary power that \Nenables effective use of the Gluttony skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:54.70,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You'll have better night vision, \Nbe able to track prey by scent...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:57.41,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,And weaker prey will \Nbe terrified, and paralyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.17,0:17:02.80,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:06.68,main,Fate,0,0,0,,No wonder the goblins have \Njust been standing there...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:08.59,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm going to help myself, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:22.27,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Not enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.27,0:17:25.52,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Let's head on over to\N the Hobgoblin Forest, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.03,0:17:48.67,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,How much more do I need...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.68,0:17:57.52,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,before I'm free of this hunger?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.20,0:18:12.30,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Looks like that did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:15.26,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I never wanna feel like this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.26,0:18:17.86,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,In that case, you'll need to hunt \Nmonsters every now and then
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.86,0:18:20.60,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,and feed souls to Gluttony.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.60,0:18:22.70,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah. I guess I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.90,0:18:25.39,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What the—?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.93,0:18:32.46,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:36.49,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,A Goblin king.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:38.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Goblin king?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.53,0:18:43.22,top,Greed,0,0,0,,He doesn't have much \Nof an edge on you, stat-wise.
