Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:46.90,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\c&HF8F8F7&\pos(159.95,261.389)}[Skills]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:46.90,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F8F7&\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(235.99,313.773)}Health Regeneration
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.22,0:18:45.02,top,Fate,0,0,0,,What's this "Health Regeneration" skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:46.89,top,Greed,0,0,0,,It heals your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:50.22,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,With it, you'd be able to keep fighting, \Neven if you get injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:18:52.49,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Well, I definitely want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.51,0:19:02.34,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What are you freaking out for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:04.91,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Humans are a fine meal for monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.43,0:19:07.06,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I understand that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:15.87,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Slow and stealthy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.87,0:19:16.97,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.43,0:19:18.84,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Now, get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.14,0:19:24.82,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Nice, you got the drop on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:31.62,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Stop spacing out! Dodge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.03,0:19:40.82,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You're not gonna beat him by running, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.82,0:19:42.46,main,Fate,0,0,0,,But that club is—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.46,0:19:45.49,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It's nothing to fear! Put your trust in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.49,0:19:47.08,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Got it! I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:53.76,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Now! Let him have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.71,0:20:06.98,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:09.10,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Increasing stats.
