Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:12.19,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Skill Health Regeneration has been added.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.23,0:20:12.19,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs13\pos(341.135,306.105)}Health Regeneration
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.31,0:20:15.57,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.57,0:20:17.02,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:20.30,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,With your stats, I should be \Nable to access my first level.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:22.26,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Your first... level?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.26,0:20:24.50,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It's another form of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:27.23,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,If you hand over your stats\N as an offering to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.23,0:20:29.63,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I can provide you with new functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.63,0:20:32.57,main,Fate,0,0,0,,A new form? I'd like to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.57,0:20:35.15,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Then hand over the stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.15,0:20:38.10,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Okay. How much do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:40.92,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Everything you've gained since meeting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:42.37,main,Fate,0,0,0,,All of that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.37,0:20:44.39,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What part of "greed" didn't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.80,0:20:47.54,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That's too greedy! Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:52.15,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,If you don't unlock it, \Nyou'll lose the right to wield me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.73,0:20:54.76,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You can get stronger on your own
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:57.31,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,or make me strong, too, \Nso we can work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.31,0:20:58.55,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Time to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.55,0:20:59.59,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.54,0:21:02.03,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's not much of a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.81,0:21:05.15,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You're the only partner for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.15,0:21:08.07,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Well said. You won't regret this, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.87,0:21:14.33,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I can feel the power leaving me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:17.04,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,My stats... are being stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.13,0:21:23.97,main,Fate,0,0,0,,So this is Greed's new power?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.82,0:21:26.21,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,A magic bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.43,0:21:28.78,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Magic bow...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.78,0:21:31.96,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,There's been someone eyeing \Nyou up for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:35.45,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Perfect timing. Let's take a shot at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.45,0:21:36.95,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Where are the arrows?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.95,0:21:39.44,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Draw on the bow,\Nand they'll appear on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.80,0:21:46.17,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You can aim wherever, and it'll still land.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.17,0:21:49.49,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Perfect for a novice like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.98,0:21:52.44,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Wow...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.84,0:22:00.96,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Goblin king ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:04.00,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That should keep you fed for a while.
